T* (1. Introduction) Tj
T* (There has been discussion around the world on AI governance, or how systems comprising) Tj
T* (AI as an element, AI services that make the systems available, other related services,) Tj
T* (and developers, users and service providers should be governed.) Tj
T* (In Japan, the AI Strategy 2019, revised based on follow-ups this year, and the) Tj
T* (Integrated Innovation Strategy 2020 are requesting relevant ministries to discuss ideal) Tj
T* (approaches to AI governance in Japan, including regulation, standardization, guidelines,) Tj
T* (and audits, conducive to the competitiveness of Japanese industry and increased social) Tj
T* (acceptance, for the purpose of operationalizing the AI Principles, taking domestic and) Tj
T* (international AI trends into account.) Tj
T* (Similar discussion can also be seen in Europe and the United States, where basic) Tj
T* (policies about regulations on AI systems and more specific regulations have been) Tj
T* (discussed and published.) Tj
T* (Global Partnership on AI, launched in June 2020, is an international effort for) Tj
T* (operationalizing OECD AI Principles.) Tj
