(While the discussion on AI governance is developing in Japan and around the world, it is) Tj
T* (not easy to design actual AI governance.) Tj
T* (Some may think that horizontal regulation can address issues unique to AI such as lack) Tj
T* (of explainability.) Tj
T* (On the other hand, solution to the issues can be sector-specific or use-case-specific) Tj
T* (because AI can apply to various fields and uses and can raise different issues in each) Tj
T* (application.) Tj
T* (Discussion on the design of appropriate monitoring and enforcement mechanisms is also) Tj
T* (required in order to make the governance effective.) Tj
T* (We need to structure this complex and multi-layered governance while avoiding hindering) Tj
T* (innovation as well as addressing concerns regarding AI systems and services.) Tj
T* (AI governance is an urgent issue that we cannot solve without the knowledge and) Tj
T* (experience of experts from various fields.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The report defines AI governance as design and operation of technological,) Tj
T* (organizational, and social systems by stakeholders for the purpose of managing risks) Tj
T* (posed by the use of AI at levels acceptable to stakeholders and maximizing their) Tj
T* (positive impact.) Tj
T* (The report discusses trends in AI governance in Japan and around the world, summarizes) Tj
T* (the development of AI governance discussion, elaborates risk discussion, and defines a) Tj
T* (universal structure comprising goals, intermediate rules, and rules focusing on specific) Tj
T* (areas such as sectors.) Tj
T* (It maps AI principles, horizontal regulations, guidelines, standards, and regulations on) Tj
T* (specific applications, specific sectors and use by the government in the universal) Tj
T* (structure with a monitoring and enforcement mechanism.) Tj
T* (It discusses ideal approaches to AI governance in Japan by taking domestic and) Tj
T* (international AI trends into account.) Tj
T* (It proposes the AI governance architecture that is ideal in Japan at the moment and) Tj
T* (identifies issues that have not been fully discussed.) Tj
